"""Build a standalone offline dashboard from a completed run."""
import json


def build_dashboard(directory):
    payload = (directory / "dashboard_data.json").read_text()
    template = r'''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Crypto Carry Research</title>
<style>body{margin:0;background:#f1f0e9;color:#17332e;font:16px system-ui}main{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:32px 24px}h1{font:clamp(34px,6vw,62px) Georgia;margin:16px 0}p{line-height:1.6}#status{background:#f9d68d;padding:16px;border-left:4px solid #a26e19}.controls{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:24px 0}select,button,input{padding:8px;font:inherit}label{display:grid;gap:7px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:16px}.card{padding:20px;background:white}.card strong{display:block;font:30px Georgia;margin-top:10px}canvas{width:100%;height:300px;background:white;margin-top:24px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:white;margin:20px 0}th,td{text-align:right;padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}th:first-child,td:first-child{text-align:left}footer,small{color:#51625c}#scenario{background:white;padding:24px}a{color:#14624e}</style>
<main><p>Crypto Carry &amp; Execution Lab</p><h1>Carry economics</h1><p id="status"></p><small id="asof"></small>
<div class="controls"><label>Asset<select id="asset"><option>BTCUSDT</option><option>ETHUSDT</option></select></label><label>Policy<select id="policy"><option value="threshold">Funding threshold</option><option value="continuous">Continuous carry</option><option value="spot">Unhedged spot</option></select></label><label>Chart<select id="metric"><option value="net_pnl">Net P&amp;L · USDT</option><option value="funding_total">Funding received · USDT</option><option value="margin_buffer">Margin buffer · USDT</option><option value="residual_delta_usdt">Residual delta · USDT</option><option value="basis_bps">Perp basis · bps</option></select></label><button id="download">Download ledger CSV</button></div>
<div class="cards"><div class="card">Net P&amp;L · USDT<strong id="pnl"></strong></div><div class="card">Return on total capital<strong id="ret"></strong></div><div class="card">Funding · USDT<strong id="funding"></strong></div><div class="card">Fees · USDT<strong id="fees"></strong></div></div><canvas id="chart" width="1060" height="300" aria-label="Selected strategy time series"></canvas><p id="range"></p>
<h2>Two-leg attribution</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Spot P&amp;L</th><th>Perp P&amp;L</th><th>Funding</th><th>Fees</th><th>Net P&amp;L</th></tr></thead><tbody id="attribution"></tbody></table><p>Slippage is embedded in spot and perpetual P&amp;L. Financing is zero in this sample. Every asset and policy starts with a separate 100,000 USDT sleeve.</p>
<h2>Margin stress scenarios</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Scenario</th><th>P&amp;L · USDT</th><th>Margin buffer · USDT</th><th>Extra collateral · USDT</th></tr></thead><tbody id="stress"></tbody></table>
<h2>Contract calculator</h2><div id="scenario"><p>Independent flat-price, one-settlement scenario. Equal base quantities on both legs. Fees include entry and exit on both legs.</p><div class="controls"><label>Matched notional · USDT<input id="notional" type="number" min="0" value="55000"></label><label>Funding per settlement · %<input id="rate" type="number" step="0.01" value="0.01"></label><label>Spot fee each side · bps<input id="sf" type="number" min="0" value="10"></label><label>Perp fee each side · bps<input id="pf" type="number" min="0" value="5"></label></div><p id="calc" role="status"></p></div>
<h2>Method and limits</h2><p>Signals observed at one settlement are first eligible for execution at the next observation, after funding settlement. Partial fills are explicit scenario inputs. Margin breach forces a sampled-price unwind and halts entries. Margin estimates use a flat maintenance rate and closing reserve. Historical tier rules and intrainterval liquidation require additional data.</p><p>The three forecast baselines are evaluated separately in forecast_comparison.csv. Strategy replay uses the last settled funding rate. A rolling mean, ridge AR(1), and EWMA diagnostic have been implemented. Incremental strategy benefit remains to be evaluated.</p><footer>Offline snapshot. Market-data collection, locked out-of-sample research, hosted refresh and forward paper outcomes remain pending. Contract universe covers linear USDT-settled instruments. USDT equals USD in base replay, with depeg explored separately.</footer></main>
<script>const data=PAYLOAD;const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);const num=x=>Number(x).toLocaleString('en',{maximumFractionDigits:2});$('status').textContent=data.receipt.status;$('asof').textContent='As of '+data.receipt.as_of+' · UTC · Run '+data.receipt.run_id;
function selected(){return data.ledger.filter(r=>r.symbol===$('asset').value&&r.policy===$('policy').value)}function update(){const rows=selected(),s=data.summary.find(r=>r.symbol===$('asset').value&&r.policy===$('policy').value);$('pnl').textContent=num(s.net_pnl);$('ret').textContent=(s.return_on_total_capital*100).toFixed(2)+'%';$('funding').textContent=num(s.funding);$('fees').textContent=num(s.fees);$('attribution').innerHTML='<tr>'+[s.spot_pnl,s.perp_pnl,s.funding,-s.fees,s.net_pnl].map(x=>'<td>'+num(x)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>';const c=$('chart'),ctx=c.getContext('2d'),vals=rows.map(r=>r[$('metric').value]),lo=Math.min(...vals),hi=Math.max(...vals);ctx.clearRect(0,0,c.width,c.height);ctx.font='13px system-ui';for(let i=0;i<5;i++){const y=260-i*55;ctx.fillStyle='#52665c';ctx.fillText(num(lo+(hi-lo)*i/4),5,y);ctx.strokeStyle='#ddd';ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(100,y);ctx.lineTo(1040,y);ctx.stroke()}ctx.strokeStyle='#17604e';ctx.lineWidth=2;ctx.beginPath();vals.forEach((v,i)=>{let x=100+i/(vals.length-1)*940,y=260-(v-lo)/(hi-lo||1)*220;i?ctx.lineTo(x,y):ctx.moveTo(x,y)});ctx.stroke();$('range').textContent=rows[0].timestamp+' → '+rows.at(-1).timestamp}
['asset','policy','metric'].forEach(id=>$(id).onchange=update);$('stress').innerHTML=data.stress.map(s=>'<tr><td>'+s.scenario.replaceAll('_',' ')+'</td><td>'+num(s.economic_pnl_usdt)+'</td><td>'+num(s.margin_buffer_after_haircut)+'</td><td>'+num(s.additional_collateral_required)+'</td></tr>').join('');function calc(){const n=+$('notional').value,r=+$('rate').value/100,s=+$('sf').value,p=+$('pf').value;if(![n,r,s,p].every(Number.isFinite)||Math.min(n,s,p)<0){$('calc').textContent='Enter finite inputs and nonnegative notional and fees.';return}const f=n*r,c=2*n*(s+p)/10000;$('calc').textContent='Funding '+num(f)+' USDT − round-trip fees '+num(c)+' USDT = net '+num(f-c)+' USDT before slippage and financing.'}['notional','rate','sf','pf'].forEach(id=>$(id).oninput=calc);$('download').onclick=()=>{const rows=selected(),keys=Object.keys(rows[0]),csv=[keys.join(','),...rows.map(r=>keys.map(k=>r[k]).join(','))].join('\n'),url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([csv],{type:'text/csv'})),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='carry-ledger.csv';a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(url)};calc();update();</script></html>'''
    if 'RETROSPECTIVE MARKET' in json.loads(payload)['receipt']['status']:
        template=template.replace('The three forecast baselines are evaluated separately in forecast_comparison.csv. Strategy replay uses the last settled funding rate. A rolling mean, ridge AR(1), and EWMA diagnostic have been implemented. Incremental strategy benefit remains to be evaluated.', 'This dashboard shows the fixed October-December 2025 historical holdout. Three causal forecast families and their matched threshold strategies are evaluated in forecast_errors.csv, summary.csv and the research report. Development and validation results are separate. Better error or lower turnover does not establish alpha.')
        template=template.replace('Offline snapshot. Market-data collection, locked out-of-sample research, hosted refresh and forward paper outcomes remain pending.', 'Historical snapshot, not live performance. 2025 market coverage was audited; the study was frozen before return inspection. A read-only paper collector is supplied separately. No forward track record is claimed.')
        template=template.replace('<h2>Margin stress scenarios</h2>', '<h2>Hypothetical margin stress scenarios</h2>')
    (directory / "dashboard.html").write_text(template.replace("PAYLOAD", payload))
